{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"f867adac-9e2b-422d-9abb-30bf64062345":{"type":"slideshow","blocks":{"template--14486593044609__f867adac-9e2b-422d-9abb-30bf64062345-167820966345fc81bc-0":{"type":"image","settings":{"top_subheading":"","title":"Play Kits","title_size":60,"subheading":"All-in-one activity kits packed with safe, durable equipment for group games, skill-building, and active fun at school, home, or recreation programs.","link":"","link_text":"","link_2":"","link_text_2":"","color_accent":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_align":"vertical-bottom horizontal-left","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SPORTSKIT-Sports-Kit-BatInUse-800x1000px_b1fc2ebf-1f68-4bc1-b32d-5b0ba4b6d573.jpg","parallax_direction":"left","overlay_opacity":32,"focal_point":"center center"}}},"block_order":["template--14486593044609__f867adac-9e2b-422d-9abb-30bf64062345-167820966345fc81bc-0"],"settings":{"section_height":"450px","mobile_height":"400px","parallax":false,"style":"bars","autoplay":true,"autoplay_speed":5}},"text_and_image_EtwkPp":{"type":"text-and-image","name":"t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SAFEPK-Safe-Play-Kit-800x1000px_26e8ff2a-0929-40df-a083-bb31b39ee9b8.png","image_width":570,"subtitle":"Safe Fun Activities","title":"Safe Play Kit","text":"<p>A complete kit of PU foam balls and accessories designed for safe, active play. Perfect for home, school, or group activities while developing motor skills and coordination.<\/p>","button_label":"shop Safe Play Kit","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/safe-play-kit","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"text_and_image_UctNfn":{"type":"text-and-image","name":"t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SAFEPK-Safe-Play-Kit-Layout-800x1000px_384c7c73-a67e-49a8-b15b-2dfa22caf102.png","image_width":390,"subtitle":"Safe Play Kit","title":"includes:","text":"<p>Constructed with coated PU foam for ultimate safety. The Safe Play Kit includes the following:<\/p><ul><li>1 x 7.5″ PU Basketball<\/li><li>1 x 8.5″ PU Frisbee<\/li><li>1 x 7.5″ PU Soccer Ball<\/li><li>1 x 8.5″ PU Spiral Football<\/li><li>1 x 8.5″ PU Baseball<\/li><li>1 x Mesh Carry Bag<\/li><\/ul>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"text_and_image_L8FjnP":{"type":"text-and-image","name":"t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PARAKIT-Parachute-Kit-2021-800x1000px.png","image_width":480,"subtitle":"Cooperative Play Fun","title":"Parachute Kit","text":"<p>A fun, all-in-one kit designed for parachute games and group activities. Featuring soft, PU-coated and lightweight items, this set promotes coordination, teamwork, and safe active play for children of all ages in schools, gyms, and recreational programs.<br\/><br\/><strong>Includes:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Set of six Rainbow 4\" Perforated Practice Balls<\/li><li>Ultra Skin Ball – Red<\/li><li>Set of six Rainbow Softex Balls<\/li><li>PVC Tossable Chicken<\/li><li>Two 24\" Beach Balls<\/li><li>Two Soft Sponge Giant Dice<\/li><\/ul>","button_label":"Shop Parachute Kit","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/parachute-kit","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"61c19b45-bc92-4b12-a9c1-952bbbf79aa2":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/RBJKIT-Rubber-Ball-Kits-800x1000px.jpg","image_width":400,"subtitle":"","title":"Rubber Ball Kits","text":"<p>All-in-one rubber ball kits designed for schools and recreation programs. Available in Junior and Intermediate variants, each set includes a complete assortment of durable Playground Series balls—perfect for PE classes, schoolyards, and commu